  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>6f98e35d5fdbd3bd0da3521c4dab477b</srcmd5>
    <version>0.145.0</version>
    <time>1795805082</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 0.145.0
  * Features
    - acp:
      - ACP mode now supports permissions, client file system and
        terminal access, slash commands, plans and authentication
        errors.
      - Extensions now work in ACP mode.
    - acpserver:
      - The ACP server supports changing the model of a session
        (`session/set_model`).
    - agent:
      - Failed streaming steps are resumed after transient errors.
    - agents:
      - Agents can be defined by name, and each agent can have its
        own tool restrictions.
    - app:
      - Token counts and context fill are updated after every step.
    - auth:
      - Kit starts without API keys, and a `/connect` dialog lets
        you enter a key.
    - codemode:
      - A new code mode tool runs JavaScript that calls other tools.
    - compaction:
      - Compaction uses adaptive budgets, estimates tokens over
        full message parts and anchors its summaries.
      - On context overflow errors, the conversation is compacted
        automatically and the request is retried.
    - config:
      - A `noOAuth` flag skips OAuth for public MCP servers.
      - Custom models can set their own `baseUrl` and `apiKey`.</comment>
    <requestid>1401130</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
